  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inclusive Private Sector Enabling Environment - CIPE Consortia - Inclusive Business Enabling Environment</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Inclusive Private Sector Enabling Environment - CIPE Consortia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CIPE and its consortia will pursue the following two objectives during the project:
Objective 1: To empower marginalized groups and communities to participate effectively in and benefit from economic development and trade.
Objective 2: To strengthen the ability of the private sector to engage in effective policy reform that leads to positive regulatory and policy changes conducive for the Ethiopian private sector at the national, regional, and sub-regional levels.
Objective 3  To assist BMOs, business owners, and marginal economic actors in their responses to the COVID 19 health crisis
Objective 4  To increase awareness and to foster collaboration among chambers of commerce and BMOs in contributing to economic recover</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det f&#xf6;reslagna initiativet syftar till en bottom-up modell och en lokal strategi till den privata sektorns utveckling f&#xf6;r att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra &#xf6;kandet av storleken p&#xe5; den privata sektorn, dess organisatoriska kapacitet och dess politiska samt ekonomiska roll. Vidare syftar den till att nyttja den nuvarande politiska viljan och ett befintligt engagemang f&#xf6;r att m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;ra utveckling av den privata sektorn f&#xf6;r &#xf6;kad tillv&#xe4;xt, samt f&#xf6;r en starkare dialog mellan den privata- och offentliga sektorn.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed initiative aims for a bottom-up and local approach to private sector development in order to increase the size of private sector, its organizational capacity, and its political and economic role. Further more, it aims to seize the current opportunity of political will and commitment for opening up of the environment for private sector development and inclusive growth for a stronger private public dialogues.</narrative>
  </description>
